# Golden determinism fixtures are byte-exact under NFR-0. Mark them `-text` so
# git never applies EOL conversion or appends a final newline on checkout: a
# single mutated byte would break the determinism gate (AC-1.6) and the Batch-2
# cross-machine harness. Under NFR-0 the byte contract must be STORED intact,
# not merely recomputed.
packages/recon/fixtures/golden/report.json     -text
packages/recon/fixtures/golden/manifest.json   -text
packages/recon/fixtures/golden/ledger.json     -text
packages/recon/fixtures/golden/reportHash.txt  -text
